    <div class="intro-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-header">
          <p class="eyebrow">What I do</p>
          <h2>A different kind of care</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="intro-body">
          <p>Five Element Acupuncture understands health as a dynamic balance. When that balance is disrupted — through stress, illness, grief, or simply the weight of daily life — it can show up physically, emotionally, or as a quiet sense of being out of tune with yourself.</p>
          <p>Each treatment is completely individual. I focus on identifying the root patterns behind your symptoms and supporting your body's natural capacity for regulation and healing, using fine acupuncture needles and gentle heat therapy where appropriate.</p>
          <p>My practice is rooted in compassion and careful listening. My aim isn't just symptomatic relief — it's lasting change: helping you feel more settled, resilient, and at ease in yourself.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="intro-pull">"Treatment works with the whole person — physical, emotional, and energetic. The goal is not to treat the condition. It's to treat you."</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

