      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">01</div>
        <h3>Initial consultation</h3>
        <p class="step-detail">We'll spend 90 minutes together. I'll ask about your health history, your current concerns, and anything else that feels relevant. You'll also receive your first acupuncture treatment in this session.</p>
        <span class="step-price">£95 · 90 minutes</span>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">02</div>
        <h3>Follow-up treatments</h3>
        <p class="step-detail">Ongoing sessions are 45–60 minutes, always tailored to what your body needs that day. Acupuncture works cumulatively — a short series of sessions is usually recommended to let the effects build.</p>
        <span class="step-price">£70 · 45–60 minutes</span>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">03</div>
        <h3>Your treatment plan</h3>
        <p class="step-detail">After your initial session I'll put together a treatment plan tailored to your needs. This may include gentle lifestyle suggestions alongside acupuncture to support long-term balance.</p>
        <span class="step-price">Included</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

